Dear OSF Gurus:

One of my Alpha XP1000s running Tru64 v4.0F has crashed a dozen or so
times since yesterday morning.  I bought the machine three years ago. 
I suspect a hardware failure on the motherboard very close to the cpu,
perhaps one of the cache chips, perhaps the cpu itself.  The crash
appears to involve the same memory addresses.  I am attaching one of
the crash dump files.  If anyone on this listserv can provide a
diagnosis, I would appreciate it.  Thank you.

Marc Gagne
